WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.955
Eight equals five plus three. Both sides have the same value.

00:00:04.783 --> 00:00:08.538
Combine five objects and three objects. Together there are eight.

00:00:09.367 --> 00:00:11.479
Ten minus what number gives seven?

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:17.185
Take away three from ten to leave seven. The missing number is three.
